<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Invesco raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Invesco raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential has raised its rating for Britain's Invesco Plc to buy from hold, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 38-1/4 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
